            <div type="apparatus">
                
            </div>
            
            <div type="translation" source="bib:Kuppusamy+al2010_01">
                <p n="1">Hail!</p>
                <p n="1-2">When the illustrious Lord of the great region, he who conquers what ever country he sees and he who shall not give the country he had conquered, the supreme Lord of the four oceans, Virupākṣa-tēva-mahā-irāyār ... on Friday, the tenth day of the bright fortnight of the month of Siṃha in the year ... Kara ...</p>
